<title>SPAIN: Spain 6-mth T-bill yield rises to 5.573 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 6-mth T-bill yield rises to 5.573 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Tuesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE   Yield    Pvs     Price   Pvs     Bid	Allocated</p>
<p> 6-mo   5.573   5.551   97.23   97.27   197.35   73.40</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
